            "review_title": "Review at Kieu Bao Barbecue",
            "review_text": "Mia Dang\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam10 contributions\n1\nMust Tryyyyy\nOct 2023 • Family\nFor any tourist seeking to savor authentic Vietnamese street food, I highly recommend trying the Bun Thit Nuong. It's an incredibly enticing dish featuring vermicelli noodles paired with tender and aromatic grilled meat, crispy spring rolls, complemented by a delectable sweet and sour fish sauce, and served with a selection of fresh vegetables. Even as a local resident, I remain addicted to this culinary gem; it's not only delicious but also remarkably budget-friendly!\nRead more\nWritten October 12, 2023",
