            "review_text": "AussieRicho1\nWollongong, Australia1696 contributions\n0\nSensational - A Must Eat Experience\nJun 2019 • Friends\nBun Thit Nuong is a classic vietnamese dish ... grilled pork,noodles and 'magic' sauce. For 26,000 dong.... yes $1.60 AUS. its AMAZING TASTE AND VALUE. Add an extra medium size spring roll for 50 cents. They do plenty of takeaway but you get more salad leaves if you eat in. There is an upstairs so do yourself a favor. We have eaten here 4 times in 4 days plus a few take away spring rolls just for snacks.\nRead more\nWritten June 14, 2019",
